{"text": "Alice was sitting by the river with her sister. She was bored, because her sister's book had no pictures. Suddenly, a White Rabbit with a pocket watch ran past. 'Oh dear! I shall be late!' he said. Alice ran after the Rabbit and saw him jump into a big rabbit hole. She jumped in too, and she fell down, down, down, past cupboards, maps and jars. At the bottom, she found a tiny golden key and a very small door to a beautiful garden. Then she found a little bottle. 'Drink me,' it said. Alice drank it, and she became very small!", "words": [[0.5, 0.84], [0.86, 0.96], [1.0, 1.28], [1.36, 1.48], [1.52, 1.58], [1.68, 1.9], [1.98, 2.1], [2.12, 2.2], [2.26, 2.62], [3.38, 3.46], [3.5, 3.62], [3.7, 4.08], [4.14, 4.38], [4.4, 4.46], [4.52, 4.84], [4.9, 5.12], [5.2, 5.32], [5.4, 5.48], [5.6, 6.16], [7.76, 8.14], [8.26, 8.29], [8.4, 8.68], [8.74, 9.06], [9.1, 9.2], [9.22, 9.25], [9.28, 9.64], [9.7, 9.94], [10.0, 10.16], [10.22, 10.66], [11.2, 11.5], [11.58, 11.82], [12.1, 12.13], [12.16, 12.3], [12.32, 12.38], [12.46, 12.96], [13.12, 13.16], [13.24, 13.54], [15.06, 15.38], [15.46, 15.64], [15.72, 15.94], [15.96, 16.02], [16.06, 16.42], [16.72, 16.82], [16.88, 17.02], [17.06, 17.16], [17.26, 17.52], [17.6, 17.74], [17.8, 17.83], [17.88, 18.02], [18.12, 18.38], [18.46, 18.74], [20.2, 20.28], [20.36, 20.64], [20.68, 20.76], [20.84, 21.06], [21.46, 21.54], [21.58, 21.64], [21.7, 21.88], [21.94, 22.2], [22.3, 22.56], [22.64, 22.94], [23.06, 23.38], [23.44, 23.82], [23.88, 24.2], [24.22, 24.32], [24.36, 24.78], [26.3, 26.4], [26.44, 26.5], [26.54, 26.92], [27.2, 27.28], [27.34, 27.58], [27.62, 27.65], [27.7, 28.04], [28.14, 28.46], [28.54, 28.78], [29.2, 29.3], [29.32, 29.35], [29.38, 29.58], [29.7, 29.96], [30.04, 30.24], [30.32, 30.38], [30.44, 30.47], [30.5, 30.92], [30.98, 31.38], [32.86, 33.02], [33.08, 33.14], [33.22, 33.46], [33.5, 33.53], [33.56, 33.76], [33.8, 34.22], [34.4, 35.02], [35.1, 35.24], [35.46, 35.54], [35.64, 35.9], [36.46, 36.72], [36.76, 37.06], [37.12,